This university project adapts the DGL architecture to PyTorch Geometric.
The cross-gated fusion, temporal encoder and classifier follow the upstream
architecture. Project modifications include PyG batching/graph construction,
validated encoder semantics, reproducible preprocessing/splitting/training,
payload controls, and conservative TLS/capture-provenance analyses.
These modifications do not establish independent invention of the architecture.
